    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***3 BEDROOM SEMI DETACHED HOUSE***\r\n\r\nKillian Lynch Auctioneers are pleased to offer this spacious 3 bedroom semi detached house with landscaped gardens. The property comprises of C.1195 sq ft living accommodation and is in turnkey condition throughout. It also has a good BER rating of B making it an energy efficient house & qualifies it for a green mortgage. This property would make for a fantastic family home ideally located only C.5 minutes walking distance to Millstreet town, C.25 minutes drive to Macroom town, C.25 minutes drive to Mallow and C.45 minutes drive to Cork city.\r\n\r\nServices: Mains water & drainage, oil fired central heating, electricity"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 6.0m x 1.8m \r\nTiled flooring\r\n\r\nLiving room - 4.7m x 4.1m \r\nWooden flooring, open fire with wooden surround, bay window, french doors to kitchen \r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room - 6.0m x 4.1m \r\nTiled flooring, fitted kitchen, worktop, sink, integrated extractor fan, french doors to rear garden, door to side garden\r\n\r\nW.C. - 1.4m x 1.4m \r\nTiled flooring, W.C., W.H.B. \r\n\r\nLanding - 3.8m x 1.6m \r\nCarpet flooring, hotpress\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 3.7m \r\nWooden flooring, fitted wardrobes, bay window\r\n\r\nEn-suite - 2.2m x 1.7m \r\nTiled flooring, W.C., W.H.B., power shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.4m x 3.0m \r\nWooden flooring, fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.7m x 2.5m \r\nCarpet flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.6m x 2.0m \r\nTiled flooring, W.C., W.H.B., bath with overhead electric shower\r\n\r\n"
      },
